{"id":"n32205-2-8","stage":0,"title":"누나 · 姐姐","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n32205-2-8-1","ko":"아까 인사한 사람 아는 사람이야?","zh":"刚才打招呼的那个人，你是认识的吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65974","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}},{"text":"인사한","meaning":"问候，打招呼","explanation":"인사하다：问候，打招呼；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"인사하다","audio":"/audio/fcac58187243534b5213.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17178","senseId":"1","lemma":"인사하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인사한","audio":"/audio/9bb8c837a98908adbb4d.mp3"}},{"text":"사람","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}},{"text":"아는","meaning":"认识，相识","explanation":"알다：认识，相识；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"10","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아는","audio":"/audio/4ac69e5a586c3d19cbfa.mp3"}},{"text":"사람이야?","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람이야","audio":"/audio/8ba3193df6d48d1842b5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚才，方才，刚刚","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65974","definition":"不久以前。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"